# Julia env Manifests. Root is a library (never pin). docs/ + bench/ dev DRM via
# a machine-specific path, so their Manifests aren't portable; Phase 1.0 (Grace)
# pins portable docs/+bench/ Manifests via a relative dev path.
/Manifest.toml
/docs/Manifest.toml
/bench/Manifest.toml
